<view class="pageDemo"><mx-nav title="上传" /><view style="height:{{navHeight}}px;"></view><view class="demoIntro"><desc type="name" text="Upload">Upload</desc><desc>上传图片、视频或文件。组件负责选择/预览/状态展示，实际上传由业务完成。</desc></view><wrap><title type="h2">上传类型</title><desc type="prop" text="type">type</desc><desc type="value" text="image 图片、video 视频、file 文件">image 图片、video 视频、file 文件</desc><desc>上传图片（受控 + 模拟上传）</desc><view class="cons"><mx-upload type="image" src="{{imageSrc}}" status="{{imageStatus}}" percent="{{imagePercent}}" bind:upload_change="handleImageChange" bind:upload_oversize="handleOversize" /></view><desc>上传视频（受控 + 模拟上传）</desc><view class="cons"><mx-upload type="video" src="{{videoSrc}}" cover="{{videoCover}}" status="{{videoStatus}}" bind:upload_change="handleVideoChange" /></view><desc>上传文件（仅选择预览）</desc><view class="cons"><mx-upload type="file" /><view class="space"></view><mx-upload type="file" src="https://cdn.mingsixue.com/temp/1.docx" status="done" /></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">上传状态</title><desc type="prop" text="status">status</desc><desc type="value" text="uploading / done / fail">uploading / done / fail</desc><desc>上传中</desc><view class="cons"><mx-upload type="image" src="{{uploadingSrc}}" status="{{uploadingStatus}}" percent="{{uploadingPercent}}" /></view><desc>上传失败（点击可重试）</desc><view class="cons"><mx-upload type="image" src="{{failSrc}}" status="{{failStatus}}" bind:upload_retry="handleFailRetry" /></view><desc>已完成回显</desc><view class="cons"><mx-upload type="image" src="https://cdn.mingsixue.com/xcx/MXWUI/temp/img.jpg" status="done" /><view class="space"></view><mx-upload type="video" cover="https://cdn.mingsixue.com/xcx/MXWUI/temp/img.jpg" src="https://cdn.mingsixue.com/xcx/MXWUI/temp/video.mp4" status="done" /></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">自定义文案</title><desc type="prop" text="chooseText">chooseText</desc><desc type="value" text="默认按 type 显示：上传图片 / 上传视频 / 上传文件">默认按 type 显示：上传图片 / 上传视频 / 上传文件</desc><view class="cons"><mx-upload type="image" chooseText="添加图片" small /><view class="space"></view><mx-upload type="video" chooseText="添加视频" small /><view class="space"></view><mx-upload type="file" chooseText="选择文件" small /></view></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">其他</title><desc>小尺寸 / 禁用 / 不可删除</desc><view class="cons"><mx-upload type="image" width="{{160}}" small /><view class="space"></view><mx-upload type="image" disabled /><view class="space"></view><mx-upload type="image" src="https://cdn.mingsixue.com/xcx/MXWUI/temp/img.jpg" deletable="{{false}}" status="done" /></view></wrap><prop-table dataSource="{{propDocs}}" /></view> 